    "web_proTermsConditions": "Terms & conditions",
    "web_acceptanceOfTerms": "Acceptance of Terms",
    "web_acceptanceOfTermsParagraph": "By using our service, you agree to be bound by these terms. If you are using this service on behalf of an organization, you represent that you have the authority to bind that entity to these terms.",
    "web_serviceDescription": "Service Description",
    "web_serviceDescriptionParagraph": "Our Service provides real-time GPS tracking, IoT data collection, analytics, and related services through a software-as-a-service model. This includes: (a) device management interfaces, (b) data visualization tools, (c) alerting systems, and (d) API access. Service features may evolve over time and we reserve the right to modify or discontinue features with notice.",
    "web_accountRegistration": "Account Registration and Security",
    "web_accountRegistrationParagraph": "You must provide accurate registration information and keep credentials secure. You are responsible for all activities under your account, including by third parties. You must immediately notify us of any unauthorized use. For enterprise accounts, you must maintain accurate records of authorized users.",
    "web_deviceUsage": "Device Usage and Restrictions",
    "web_deviceUsageItem1": "Devices must be used in compliance with all applicable laws regarding privacy and tracking",
    "web_deviceUsageItem2": "You warrant you have proper consent for all tracking activities",
    "web_deviceUsageItem3": "Devices may not be reverse engineered, tampered with, or used outside specified environments",
    "web_deviceUsageItem4": "Certain jurisdictions may restrict GPS tracking - you are responsible for compliance",
    "web_dataOwnership": "Data Ownership and Usage Rights",
    "web_dataOwnershipParagraph": "You retain ownership of all data you submit through the Service. We are granted a limited license to process this data solely to provide and improve the Service. You warrant you have all necessary rights to any data submitted. Aggregate, anonymized data may be used for analytical purposes.",
    "web_serviceLevel": "Service Level Agreement",
    "web_serviceLevelParagraph": "We strive for 99.9% uptime but do not guarantee uninterrupted service. Scheduled maintenance will be communicated in advance when possible. Service may be temporarily unavailable due to factors beyond our control including cellular network outages, GPS signal availability, or internet disruptions.",
    "web_liabilityLimitations": "Limitations of Liability",
    "web_liabilityLimitationsParagraph": "To the maximum extent permitted by law, we shall not be liable for: (a) inaccurate location data, (b) delays in data transmission, (c) service interruptions beyond our reasonable control, (d) any consequential, indirect, or punitive damages. Our total liability is limited to fees paid during the six months preceding any claim.",
    "web_acceptableUse": "Acceptable Use Policy",
    "web_acceptableUseItem1": "No unlawful tracking or surveillance without consent",
    "web_acceptableUseItem2": "No use that violates privacy rights under GDPR, CCPA, or other regulations",
    "web_acceptableUseItem3": "No attempts to compromise system security or stability",
    "web_acceptableUseItem4": "No resale of Service without authorization",
    "web_acceptableUseItem5": "Compliance with all export control laws for international usage",
    "web_subscriptionTerms": "Subscription Terms and Billing",
    "web_subscriptionTermsParagraph": "Paid subscriptions are billed in advance on a recurring basis. Fees are non-refundable except as required by law. You must provide accurate billing information and promptly update any changes. We may suspend service for non-payment after providing notice.",
    "web_termination": "Term and Termination",
    "web_terminationParagraph": "These terms remain effective until terminated. You may terminate at any time by deleting your account. We may terminate for material breaches with 30 days notice (or immediately for violations of law or these terms). Upon termination, your right to access the Service and any stored data will cease.",
    "web_modifications": "Modifications to Terms",
    "web_modificationsParagraph": "We may modify these terms with 30 days notice. Material changes will be communicated via email or in-app notification. Continued use after changes constitutes acceptance. If you disagree with changes, you may terminate your account.",
    "web_governingLaw": "Governing Law and Dispute Resolution",
    "web_governingLawParagraph": "These terms shall be governed by Mexican law in the state of Nuevo León, excluding conflict of law provisions. Any disputes shall be resolved through binding arbitration in Monterrey, Nuevo León, under Mexican Arbitration Law rather than in court, except for injunctive relief.",
    "web_generalProvisions": "General Provisions",
    "web_generalProvisionsParagraph": "These terms constitute the entire agreement between parties. If any provision is invalid, the remainder remains enforceable. Our failure to enforce any right does not waive that right. You may not assign these terms without our written consent.",
    "web_proPrivacy": "Privacy policy",
    "web_proPrivacyParagraph": "Business & IT Acceleration México (hereinafter, 'We') is a technology company located in Monterrey Nuevo León, Mexico. One of our priorities is to respect the privacy of its users and keep safe the personal information and data it collects.",
    "web_privacyPersonalData": "Personal data",
    "web_privacyPersonalDataParagraph": "Your personal data will be processed based on the principles of lawfulness, consent, information, quality, loyalty, proportionality and responsibility, and will be used for the following purposes: To provide the requested and/or contracted services. To respond to your information, attention and service requests. To evaluate the quality of service we provide. Financial management, billing and collection. To comply with the obligations and commitments we have made with you. We commit not to sell, disclose, transfer or distribute your personal data to third parties in any way.",
    "web_privacyTechnologies": "Cookies and similar technologies",
    "web_privacyTechnologiesParagraph": "You expressly acknowledge and agree that We may use a behavior tracking system through the use of cookies or other similar technologies. These technologies are used to understand the interests and behavior of those who visit or are users of our website and thus provide them with better service or related information. We also use them so that the user does not have to enter their password as frequently during a browsing session. You should know that the installation, permanence and existence of cookies on your computer or device depends on your exclusive will and can be deleted when you wish. To learn how to remove Cookies from the system, you need to check the Help section of your browser. If you disable cookies, please note that you may not be able to use and enjoy all the functionalities we offer.",
    "web_privacyChanges": "Privacy policy updates",
    "web_privacyChangesParagraph": "If we make changes to the way we process your personal data, you will be notified in advance through an individual notification via our usual communication channels (e.g. by email), as well as through our websites or applications (via banners, pop-up messages or other notification mechanisms).",
    "web_termsAcceptanceParagraph": "By clicking the button above, you agree to our",
